<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Certificate of Authenticity — Draft — {{ case.id }}</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 2rem; color: #111; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .draft-label { color: #b00; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 1rem; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: left; }
  td.hash { font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Certificate of Authenticity (BSA §63) — <span class="draft-label">Draft — officer signature required</span></h1>
  <p>Case ID: {{ case.id }} · Generated: {{ generated_at }}</p>
  <p>This certificate lists the evidence files and their SHA-256 hashes as computed at intake. It is a draft; it has no legal effect until the investigating officer signs it.</p>
  <table>
    <tr><th>File</th><th>SHA-256</th><th>Uploaded at</th></tr>
    {% for file in files %}
    <tr><td>{{ file.name }}</td><td class="hash">{{ file.sha256 or "rejected" }}</td><td>{{ file.uploaded_at }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>
  <p>Custody chain head hash at export: <span class="hash">{{ head_hash }}</span></p>
</body>
</html>
